{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In The Drunken Beard, you take the reins of a lively tavern where every pint tells a story. Brew craft beers, manage orders between thirsty dwarves and impatient adventurers, expand the inn and turn it into a legendary haven. Between secret recipes, rustic furnishings, and demanding customers, only the finest innkeeper will win over hearts and livers. Glory awaits\u2026 one beer at a time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/b4144ae02cb06dc776b05e364600e48c.poster.avif?t=1773036928\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/b4144ae02cb06dc776b05e364600e48c.webm?t=1773036928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/b4144ae02cb06dc776b05e364600e48c.mp4?t=1773036928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Physically shape and expand your tavern and progress your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/a8115c643028d4cc31157f51b5396453.poster.avif?t=1773036928\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/a8115c643028d4cc31157f51b5396453.webm?t=1773036928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/a8115c643028d4cc31157f51b5396453.mp4?t=1773036928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Crafting is the beating heart of &quot;The Drunken Beard&quot;, where fast-paced fun meets the satisfaction of building a thriving dwarven enterprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Prepare your finest dishes or serve legendary beers. Every beer has a story. Battle dragons, celebrate with beer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/76168aaef57ccc9a356b655281c86f74.poster.avif?t=1773036928\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/76168aaef57ccc9a356b655281c86f74.webm?t=1773036928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/76168aaef57ccc9a356b655281c86f74.mp4?t=1773036928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose your favorite character, male or female, and customize it as you like.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/b646d2c4da4d46d8636c0e95d0ee6ea0.poster.avif?t=1773036928\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/b646d2c4da4d46d8636c0e95d0ee6ea0.webm?t=1773036928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/b646d2c4da4d46d8636c0e95d0ee6ea0.mp4?t=1773036928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Not all customers are good customers! Sometimes they can make your tavern look terrible. Keep your tavern clean to increase customer approval.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay